{"ts":"2026-07-29T18:28:05.674Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"8e44c177d404faaccfcac65c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-29T18:28:05.673Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Implementation evidence: whole-workspace restore now plans exact changed/added/removed item and history impact, refuses without explicit force, captures a content-addressed recovery snapshot, stages and atomically swaps the target, and appends a durable _workspace workspace_snapshot_restore event containing actor, reason, before/target fingerprints, recovery fingerprint, and exact counts. Restore-then-return tests recover every removed item and erased history entry; CLI and public SDK compatibility paths are covered."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T18:28:05.674Z"}],"before_hash":"f64303faf04ef22860e44223a7eec01685b166b4dfcf06e4f603fe4569a7cd67","after_hash":"73be9fc840503096e203aa7d25e814e25709bc154bfa153e8dfcb09c19ea5a47"}
